<li>Music Mode's poster now sits on the album cover itself, enlarged and blurred to fill your screen, like a phone's lock screen.</li>
<li>Prefer the glow in the album's colour from before? Choose <b>Album colour</b> under Settings → Music Mode → Poster background.</li>
</ul>
